{"out": "S0E12_finale", "end": "الموسم الأوّل جايي… تابعوني", "endsub": "Season 1 is coming… follow", "lines": [{"who": "Wadad", "ar": "سعاد… حاسّة إنّو خلص دورنا.", "en": "Souad… I feel our time is up.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/aunties.png", "z": [1.55, 1.7, 0.33, 0.5], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e12_l01.mp3"}, {"who": "Souad", "ar": "إيه… صار بدّو كلوة جديدة.", "en": "Yes… he needs a new kidney.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/aunties.png", "z": [1.55, 1.7, 0.66, 0.5], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e12_l02.mp3"}, {"who": "Wadad", "ar": "ومين بدّو يعطيه؟", "en": "And who's going to give him one?", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/aunties.png", "z": [1.0, 1.1, 0.5, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e12_l03.mp3"}, {"who": "Souad", "ar": "خيّو أمين… اللي بيصفرّ إذا شاف دم.", "en": "His brother Amine… the one who goes pale at the sight of blood.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/aunties.png", "z": [1.75, 1.9, 0.66, 0.48], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e12_l04.mp3"}, {"who": "New kidney", "ar": "مرحبا يا خالات! أنا من عند أمين.", "en": "Hello, aunties! I'm from Amine.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e12_arrive.png", "z": [1.05, 1.2, 0.55, 0.58], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e12_l05.mp3"}, {"who": "Wadad", "ar": "أهلا حبيبي… انتبه عليه. نحنا رايحين نرتاح عالكنباية.", "en": "Welcome, darling… take care of him. We're off to rest on the sofa.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e12_arrive.png", "z": [1.3, 1.45, 0.3, 0.58], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e12_l06.mp3"}, {"who": "New kidney", "ar": "ولا يهمّكن. الموسم الجايي… أنا بحكي.", "en": "Don't worry. Next season… I'm talking.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e12_retire.png", "z": [1.05, 1.2, 0.5, 0.58], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e12_l07.mp3"}]}